{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_54","type":"agent_message","text":"I found a gap in review retirement: configuration changes and Harness decisions use scoped native confirmations, but API Client Apply still uses an unowned confirmation. The new renderer teardown hook leaves that API Client review intact, so its old confirmation can still authorize a send after reload. I’m checking the lifecycle tests to confirm whether this path is covered.\n"}}
